{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":89,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["困難中的聖詩"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["以斯拉人以探的訓誨詩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我要歌唱耶和華的慈愛，直到永遠；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要用口將你的信實傳與萬代。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我曾說：你的慈悲必建立到永遠；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的信實必堅立在天上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我與我所揀選的人立了約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向我的僕人大衛起了誓：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要建立你的後裔，直到永遠；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要建立你的寶座，直到萬代。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，諸天要稱讚你的奇事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在聖者的會中，要稱讚你的信實。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在天空誰能比耶和華呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"神的眾子中，誰能像耶和華呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他在聖者的會中，是大有威嚴的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比一切在他四圍的更可畏懼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華－萬軍之上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哪一個大能者像你耶和華？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的信實是在你的四圍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你管轄海的狂傲；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"波浪翻騰，你就使它平靜了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你打碎了拉哈伯，似乎是已殺的人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你用有能的膀臂打散了你的仇敵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天屬你，地也屬你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世界和其中所充滿的都為你所建立。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"南北為你所創造；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他泊和黑門都因你的名歡呼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你有大能的膀臂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的手有力，你的右手也高舉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公義和公平是你寶座的根基；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"慈愛和誠實行在你前面。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"知道向你歡呼的，那民是有福的！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，他們在你臉上的光裏行走。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們因你的名終日歡樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你的公義得以高舉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是他們力量的榮耀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你喜悅我們，我們的角必被高舉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的盾牌屬耶和華；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的王屬以色列的聖者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝對大衛的應許"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"當時，你在異象中曉諭你的聖民，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已把救助之力加在那有能者的身上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我高舉那從民中所揀選的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我尋得我的僕人大衛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用我的聖膏膏他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的手必使他堅立；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的膀臂也必堅固他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仇敵必不勒索他；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凶惡之子也不苦害他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在他面前打碎他的敵人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擊殺那恨他的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只是我的信實和我的慈愛要與他同在；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我的名，他的角必被高舉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使他的左手伸到海上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"右手伸到河上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要稱呼我說：你是我的父，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我的上帝，是拯救我的磐石。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要立他為長子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為世上最高的君王。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要為他存留我的慈愛，直到永遠；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我與他立的約必要堅定。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要使他的後裔存到永遠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他的寶座如天之久。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"text":"倘若他的子孫離棄我的律法，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不照我的典章行，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背棄我的律例，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不遵守我的誡命，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就要用杖責罰他們的過犯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用鞭責罰他們的罪孽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只是我必不將我的慈愛全然收回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必不叫我的信實廢棄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不背棄我的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不改變我口中所出的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我一次指着自己的聖潔起誓：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我決不向大衛說謊！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的後裔要存到永遠；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的寶座在我面前如日之恆一般，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如月亮永遠堅立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如天上確實的見證。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["君主慘敗的哀歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":[{"text":"但你惱怒你的受膏者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就丟掉棄絕他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你厭惡了與僕人所立的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將他的冠冕踐踏於地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你拆毀了他一切的籬笆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他的保障變為荒場。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡過路的人都搶奪他；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他成為鄰邦的羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你高舉了他敵人的右手；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你叫他一切的仇敵歡喜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你叫他的刀劍捲刃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫他在爭戰之中站立不住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":44,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使他的光輝止息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將他的寶座推倒於地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":45,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你減少他青年的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又使他蒙羞。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["求救的禱告"]},{"type":"verse","number":46,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，這要到幾時呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要將自己隱藏到永遠嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的忿怒如火焚燒要到幾時呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":47,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你想念我的時候是何等的短少；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你創造世人，要使他們歸何等的虛空呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":48,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能常活免死、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救他的靈魂脫離陰間的權柄呢？（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":49,"content":[{"text":"主啊，你從前憑你的信實","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向大衛立誓要施行的慈愛在哪裏呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":50,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，求你記念僕人們所受的羞辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"記念我怎樣將一切強盛民的羞辱存在我懷裏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":51,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你的仇敵用這羞辱羞辱了你的僕人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞辱了你受膏者的腳蹤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":52,"content":[{"text":"耶和華是應當稱頌的，直到永遠。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"阿們！阿們！","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/89.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/90.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/88.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":52}